---
import LiteYoutube from './LiteYoutube.astro';
import poster from '../assets/index-blogs-curso_impresion_3d-configurar-repetier-host/configurar repetier host.jpg';
---

<div class="repetier-host-article">
  <section class="repetier-host-article__intro gradient color-background-1">
    <div class="page-width">
      <div class="repetier-host-article__blocks rte">
        <h1>Configurar Repetier Host</h1>
        <p>Para configurar Repetier Host tienes que seguir los pasos del video y más abajo se encuentran los archivos de configuración que se mencionan en el video</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="repetier-host-article__video-section">
    <div class="page-width">
      <div class="repetier-host-article__video global-media-settings">
        <LiteYoutube
          videoId="ENIRcInoUVI"
          title="Video sobre como configurar Repetier Host"
          poster={poster}
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="ArchivosDeConfiguracion" class="repetier-host-article__content gradient color-background-1">
    <div class="page-width">
      <div class="repetier-host-article__blocks rte">
        <h2>Archivos para ejecutar el paso a paso de como configurar el Repetier Host</h2>
        <p>Ademas de los archivos tambien hay un pdf paso a paso de como hacer el proceso</p>
        <p>
          <span class="repetier-host-article__disabled-button" title="Archivo no disponible">
            <button class="button" type="button" disabled>Archivos de configuración</button>
          </span>
        </p>

        <h2>Descargar Repetier Host</h2>
        <p>Tenemos respaldo de los programas que usamos, puesto que tienen la mala costumbre de no estar disponibles en el futuro.</p>
        <p><strong>Tenemos disponible:</strong></p>
        <p>Repetier-Host Windows 2.3.1</p>
        <p>Repetier-Host Linux AppImage 2.3.1</p>
        <p>Repetier-Host Mac 1.2.1</p>
        <p><a class="button" href="https://www.repetier.com/download-now/">Servidores de Repetier</a></p>
        <p>
          <span class="repetier-host-article__disabled-button" title="Archivo no disponible">
            <button class="button" type="button" disabled>Servidores de Print3x - Repetier Windows</button>
          </span>
        </p>
        <p>
          <span class="repetier-host-article__disabled-button" title="Archivo no disponible">
            <button class="button" type="button" disabled>Servidores de Print3x - Repetier Linux</button>
          </span>
        </p>
        <p>
          <span class="repetier-host-article__disabled-button" title="Archivo no disponible">
            <button class="button" type="button" disabled>Servidores de Print3x - Repetier Mac</button>
          </span>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<style>
  .repetier-host-article__intro,
  .repetier-host-article__content {
    width: 100%;
  }

  .repetier-host-article__intro {
    padding: 4rem 0 5.2rem;
  }

  .repetier-host-article__content {
    padding: 4rem 0 7rem;
  }

  .repetier-host-article__blocks {
    max-width: 82rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .repetier-host-article__blocks h1,
  .repetier-host-article__blocks h2 {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .repetier-host-article__blocks h2 {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .repetier-host-article__blocks h2:not(:first-child) {
    margin-top: 5.2rem;
  }

  .repetier-host-article__blocks p {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .repetier-host-article__blocks p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .repetier-host-article__blocks .button {
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
    color: rgb(var(--color-button-text));
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .repetier-host-article__disabled-button {
    position: relative;
    display: inline-flex;
  }

  .repetier-host-article__disabled-button .button {
    cursor: not-allowed;
    opacity: 0.55;
  }

  .repetier-host-article__video-section {
    padding: 3.6rem 0;
  }

  .repetier-host-article__video {
    max-width: 120rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  :global(.repetier-host-article__video lite-youtube) {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: none;
    border-radius: calc(var(--media-radius) - var(--media-border-width));
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .repetier-host-article__intro {
      padding: 3rem 0 3.9rem;
    }

    .repetier-host-article__content {
      padding: 3rem 0 5rem;
    }

    .repetier-host-article__video-section {
      padding: 2.4rem 0;
    }

    .repetier-host-article__blocks h2:not(:first-child) {
      margin-top: 4rem;
    }

    .repetier-host-article__blocks .button {
      max-width: 100%;
      text-align: center;
    }
  }
</style>
